WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:08.720
Enough. This matter is settled! Every conspirator implicated in the treasonous verse has been apprehended; the traitorous minister Yu Gong shall be executed on an appointed day.

00:09.640 --> 00:15.800
As for you: meddle in this affair no further. If you cause any more trouble, even I will not be able to shield you!

00:16.040 --> 00:18.040
Your son thanks Father Emperor.

00:22.600 --> 00:29.400
You haven't visited the palace in quite some time. Stay, and play a game of Weiqi with me.
Yes, Father Emperor.
